+## API keys and audit
+
+Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` and `audit` arrays. API key records have a unique
+`key`, a display `name`, and a `role` of `viewer`, `cook`, or `manager`.
+Existing files without these arrays start with empty arrays. Add keys to the
+active data file to enable access. The seed file includes one sample key
+per role.
